```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

May 3, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration to Purchase between the City of Cheyenne, and Stryker for a Lifepak
15 Monitor/Defibrillator for the Cheyenne Fire Rescue Department
______________________________________________
This is a Sole Source purchase through Stryker, therefore no bids were requested.
Stryker is the sole source provider of Lifepak 15 monitor/defibrillators, and purchases must be
made directly through them.
The total requested purchase amount is $43,127.24.

Funding:
025-21-2111-41-46503 Project# 47600

Wyoming Department of Health, Community Emergency Medical Services Grant
```

