### Page 4 of 7

```text
REQUEST TO PURCHASE OVER $35,000.00
Consideration to Purchase between the City of Cheyenne, and Stryker for a Lifepak 15
Monitor/Defibrillator for the Cheyenne Fire Rescue Department.  This is a single source
purchase, therefore no bids were requested.  The total requested amount is $43,127.24.

This will be reviewed by the City Council Finance Committee on May 15, 2023 and voted on at
the May 22, 2023 City Council meeting.

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
City of Cheyenne, Wyoming
(307) 773-1045

Published in:  Wyoming Tribune-Eagle
Dates: May 5 & 12, 2023
```

